-## Latest preserved implementation work — 2026-08-26
+1. Binder detail actions (Favorite / Equip / Upgrade) can be activated by controller A and keyboard Enter/Space, not only mouse.
+2. B/Escape is Back/Close; A cannot close the Binder.
+3. Double-clicking a collection card, or double-confirming the same card with A/Enter, quick equips it; doing the same on an equipped card unequips it.
+4. Portable/stationary pull/reveal flash now pulses the full card cell / full reveal panel instead of a tiny local flicker.
